"info-participants\"><p>Cosmos 3A is the first room in the Cosmos 3 wing.</p>\n<p>When facing the main Cosmos Hall, access to the Cosmos 3 wing is on the left, close to the stairs. The area is accessed through a large door with the number \u201C3\u201D, which will stay open during the event.</p>\n</blockquote></div></div></div></div><div class=\"modal-footer\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/details/fse-2025/fse-2025-research-papers/33/UnitCon-Synthesizing-Targeted-Unit-Tests-for-Java-Runtime-Exceptions\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default navigate\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-new-window\"></span> All Details</a></span><a href=\"#\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" class=\"btn btn-default\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove\"></span> Close</a></div></div></div></div>"},{ "action": "runscript", "value": "$('#modal-9bf1f43b-65e0-4415-ac2c-c34365db25b5').modal({ backdrop: 'static', keyboard: true}, 'show');" },
